      "side": 1,
      "message": "Capacity here is a bit of a missnommer, and probably should be improved. Currently capacity is the maximum buffer size it will use, but since this currently allows an unlimited number of buffers to be in use, the memory usage is effectively unbounded. This probably should be adjusted to use capacity as the maximum number of total bytes buffered + in flight.",
